# sha256 of every AGENTS.md this add-on has shipped before the current one.
# A file matching any of these is still the add-on's copy, not the user's, so
# it can be refreshed. Append the outgoing hash whenever AGENTS.md changes -
# without it, everyone upgrading is told their untouched file was edited.
